      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 101,
            "column": 3
          },
          "text": "Conclusion"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 103,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 103,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "In conclusion, self-hosting Capgo can be a good option for organizations that have the resources and expertise to do so. It offers a number of benefits, including control over the update process, security, and compliance. However, it is important to carefully weigh the benefits and challenges before deciding whether to self-host."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 105,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 105,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "If you are considering self-hosting Capgo, I recommend that you start by reading the Capgo "
        },
        {
          "type": "link",
          "location": {
            "line": 105,
            "column": 92
          },
          "url": "https://capgo.app/docs/plugins/updater/self-hosted/getting-started/",
          "title": null,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "location": {
                "line": 105,
                "column": 93
              },
              "text": "self-hosting documentation"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 105,
            "column": 189
          },
          "text": ". This will give you a good understanding of the requirements and risks of self-hosting."
        }
      ]
    },
